# The gates, and who owns them. Agents may not change these files; the project
# guard fails any pull request from anyone else that touches them.
#
# __PROJECT_OWNER__ is substituted at provision time, like the version pin. A
# literal handle here would ship to every repository provisioned afterwards and
# name an account that owns none of them.

/.github/workflows/  @__PROJECT_OWNER__
/.github/CODEOWNERS  @__PROJECT_OWNER__
/CLAUDE.md           @__PROJECT_OWNER__
